# Doc Markdown (冻结)

**Do not** add per-page or per-document markdown CSS in `DocPageView.module.css`. All prose rules live in one module.

## Frozen decisions (session checkpoint)

| Area | Rule | Do not |
|------|------|--------|
| Lists | No `padding-left` on `ul`/`ol`; top-level `li + li` → `spacing-2` | Re-add list indent without explicit request |
| Table `th`/`td` | `height/min-height: scale-5` (40px); `footnote-large` 14px | Revert to 38px or body-medium size |
| Table `th` | bg `material-card-shallow`; border `stroke-outline-deep` | Use `moderate` / `subtle` for header bg |
| Inline code | `padding: 1px 6px`; `border-radius: 6px`; `display: inline-block` | Use spacing tokens for inline-code padding (broken under doc spacing halving) |
| Code blocks | Chrome + highlighted `pre`; **no line-number gutter** | Re-add line nums (reverted) |
| Preview caption | Frozen line `组件能力示例。查看演示` → brand link to 开发指南 tab | Custom per-component caption text |

## Single source of truth

| Concern | File |
|---------|------|
| Render pipeline | `src/markdown/renderMarkdown.ts` |
| Prose + code styles | `src/markdown/docMarkdown.module.css` |
| Copy button handler | `src/markdown/useDocMarkdownCopy.ts` |
| Public API | `src/markdown/index.ts` |

Usage in views:

```ts
import { docMarkdownStyles, renderMarkdown, useDocMarkdownCopy } from '@/markdown';
```

```html
<div :class="docMarkdownStyles.markdownBody" v-html="html" @click="handleMarkdownBodyClick" />
```

## Renderer rules (`renderMarkdown.ts`)

- GFM on; `breaks: false`
- `h1`: strip leading `N.` from title text; map `id` via `sectionIdsByTitle`
- Fenced code **with** lang → `docs-code-block` + chrome (lang label + copy) + `docs-fence-highlighted` + hljs
- Fenced code **without** lang → `docs-fence-plain` (ASCII diagrams)
- Image shorthand: line `!filename.png` → `/docs/{imageAssetDir}/filename.png` (set `imageAssetDir` on doc page config); `!filename.mp4` (or `.webm`/`.mov`) → `<video controls playsinline>`
- `img` / `video` — `max-width: 100%`; `box-shadow: var(--effect-shadow-subtle)`
- Preview demo link — exact line `组件能力示例。查看演示` → `查看演示` link (`data-doc-develop-link`) switches PageToc to **开发指南** tab; style: `text-brand-primary`, weight 500, underline; hover `event-hover-brand`; active `event-active-brand`
- Supported langs: js/ts/tsx/json/css/bash (+ aliases)

## Preview block (frozen, all component docs)

Every component design doc (`*.design.md`) **must** start with this block when a visual preview exists:

```md
# 预览

!preview-image.png

组件能力示例。查看演示
```

| Part | Rule |
|------|------|
| `h1` | Always `# 预览` (maps to section id `预览`) |
| Image | One `!filename` line (requires `imageAssetDir` on page config) |
| Caption | **Exactly** `组件能力示例。查看演示` — same copy for every component; do not customize |
| `查看演示` | Auto-linked to **开发指南** tab on the same page (not a route change) |

Do not hand-write `<a>` tags or per-page caption variants.

## Typography (frozen)

| Element | Rule |
|---------|------|
| Body | `typography-body-small` (16px); `text-rendering: auto` |
| `h1` | `typography-title-medium` (32px); top margin `scale-10` (0 if first) |
| `h2` | `typography-title` (24px); margin `spacing-6` (`spacing-3` after `h1`) |
| `h3` | `typography-body-medium` (18px), weight 500 |
| `h4` | `typography-body-medium` (18px) |
| `h5–h6` | weight `typography-body-large-strong` (size inherits from group margin rule) |
| `strong` | weight 500 (not 700) |

## Block spacing (frozen)

| Element | Top margin |
|---------|------------|
| `p` | `spacing-3` |
| `ul` | `spacing-2` |
| `ol` | `spacing-2-5` |
| `table` | `spacing-2` |
| `blockquote`, `pre`, `hr` | `spacing-3` |
| `h3–h6` | `spacing-2-5` |

First child in `.markdownBody` → `margin-top: 0`.

## Lists (frozen)

- **No** `padding-left` on `ul` / `ol`
- **Top-level** — `.markdownBody > ul > li + li`, `.markdownBody > ol > li + li` → `margin-top: spacing-2`
- **Nested** — `.markdownBody li ul li + li`, `.markdownBody li ol li + li` → `margin-top: spacing-2`

## Inline code (frozen)

- Font: IBM Plex Mono; `typography-footnote-large` (14px)
- Padding: `1px 6px` (hardcoded); `border-radius: 6px` (hardcoded); `display: inline-block`
- bg `material-card-moderate`
- Light: `#006e41` + `color(display-p3 0 0.4314 0.2549)`
- Dark: `#69b091` + `color(display-p3 0.41 0.69 0.57)`

## Fenced code blocks (frozen)

**Block** (`docs-code-block`): margin `spacing-2` top; `radius-md`; bg `material-card-subtle`

**Chrome** (`docs-code-chrome`): gap `spacing-2`; padding `spacing-2 spacing-1-5 spacing-1-5 spacing-2-5`
- Lang label: EDS Text (`font-family-text`), `typography-body-medium`
- Copy: `spacing-05` padding; green check on copy

**Highlighted pre** (inside block): padding `spacing-2 spacing-4 spacing-4` — **no line numbers**
**Plain pre**: padding `spacing-2`; bg `material-card-subtle`
**Font**: IBM Plex Mono 14px / 20px lh; `pre-wrap`

Syntax colors: hex fallback + display-p3 canonical pairs in `docMarkdown.module.css` — do not use global CSS or separate theme files.

## Blockquote (frozen)

- `border-left: stroke-xl solid stroke-divider-page`
- Inner gap: `spacing-05` (flex column); `padding-left: spacing-2`
- Color: `text-base-secondary`

## Table (frozen)

- Tables render inside `.docs-table-scroll` — `overflow-x: auto`; `max-width: 100%`
- `table` — `width: max(100%, calc(70 * var(--scale-base)))`; `min-width: calc(70 * var(--scale-base))` (560px); `table-layout: auto`; `border-collapse: collapse`
- `th, td` — `box-sizing: border-box`; `min-height: scale-5` (40px); `padding: spacing-1 spacing-1-5`; `vertical-align: middle`; `text-align: left`; `white-space: normal`; `overflow-wrap: anywhere`
- `th, td` font — `typography-footnote-large` (14px)
- Border (all cells): `stroke-xs solid stroke-outline-deep`
- `th` only — `background: material-card-shallow`; weight `typography-body-medium-strong`
- Inline `code` inside `th`/`td` — `display: inline`; wrap like cell text
- Container narrower than 560px → horizontal scroll via `.docs-table-scroll`
- `td` — no background override (inherits page)

## HR (frozen)

- `display: none` — markdown `---` separators are not shown

## When adding new docs

1. Write plain `.md` under `src/content/docs/` — **no** inline HTML for styling
2. Wire content in `navigation.ts` only
3. If a **new element type** is needed site-wide, extend `docMarkdown.module.css` + `renderMarkdown.ts`, not `DocPageView`
